!Sample_label_protocol_ch1	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Technologies)  following the manufacturer’s protocol.  Yields of cRNA and the dye-incorporation rate were  measured with the ND-1000 Spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies)."	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Technologies)  following the manufacturer’s protocol.  Yields of cRNA and the dye-incorporation rate were  measured with the ND-1000 Spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies)."	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Technologies)  following the manufacturer’s protocol.  Yields of cRNA and the dye-incorporation rate were  measured with the ND-1000 Spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies)."	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Technologies)  following the manufacturer’s protocol.  Yields of cRNA and the dye-incorporation rate were  measured with the ND-1000 Spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies)."	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Technologies)  following the manufacturer’s protocol.  Yields of cRNA and the dye-incorporation rate were  measured with the ND-1000 Spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies)."	"Cyanine-3 (Cy3) Cy3-labeled cRNA was prepared from 0.5 ug RNA using the Agilent Low RNA Input Linear Amp Kit (Agilent Technologies) or  the Agilent Quick Amp Labeling Kit (Agilent Te