!Sample_hyb_protocol	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized overnight (17 hours, 65°C) to Agilent Whole Human Genome Oligo Microarrays (44K, Design ID 014850) using Agilent’s recommended hybridization chamber and oven.Finally, microarrays were washed once with wash buffer 1 for 1 min at RT followed by a second wash with wash buffer 2 for 1 min at 37°C and a final wash step with acetonitrile for 30 sec at RT."	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized overnight (17 hours, 65°C) to Agilent Whole Human Genome Oligo Microarrays (44K, Design ID 014850) using Agilent’s recommended hybridization chamber and oven.Finally, microarrays were washed once with wash buffer 1 for 1 min at RT followed by a second wash with wash buffer 2 for 1 min at 37°C and a final wash step with acetonitrile for 30 sec at RT."	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized overnight (17 hours, 65°C) to Agilent Whole Human Genome Oligo Microarrays (44K, Design ID 014850) using Agilent’s recommended hybridization chamber and oven.Finally, microarrays were washed once with wash buffer 1 for 1 min at RT followed by a second wash with wash buffer 2 for 1 min at 37°C and a final wash step with acetonitrile for 30 sec at RT."	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized overnight (17 hours, 65°C) to Agilent Whole Human Genome Oligo Microarrays (44K, Design ID 014850) using Agilent’s recommended hybridization chamber and oven.Finally, microarrays were washed once with wash buffer 1 for 1 min at RT followed by a second wash with wash buffer 2 for 1 min at 37°C and a final wash step with acetonitrile for 30 sec at RT."	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized overnight (17 hours, 65°C) to Agilent Whole Human Genome Oligo Microarrays (44K, Design ID 014850) using Agilent’s recommended hybridization chamber and oven.Finally, microarrays were washed once with wash buffer 1 for 1 min at RT followed by a second wash with wash buffer 2 for 1 min at 37°C and a final wash step with acetonitrile for 30 sec at RT."	"Cy3 labeled cRNAs were hybridized over